-## CI ↔ lokaal (spiegel)
-
-| CI (`validate.yml` / `pages.yml`)                                        | Lokaal                                  |
-| ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
-| sync + validate (`--fail-on-warnings`) + generate + hugo + interne links | `scripts\check.cmd --strict`            |
-| externe http(s)-links (non-blocking in CI)                               | `scripts\check.cmd --strict --external` |
